{"lesson":{"id":"sample-quad","date":"2026-09-01","topicId":"s4_quad1","title":"配方法解二次方程（示例）","summary":"把 $x^2 + bx + c = 0$ 配成完全平方，再兩邊開方。此則為示例堂課，老師可刪除或改寫。","problems":[{"id":"sample-quad-p1","label":"例 1","prompt":"解方程 $x^2 - 6x + 5 = 0$。","promptImages":[],"solution":"左邊配方：\n\n$$x^2 - 6x + 5 = (x-3)^2 - 9 + 5 = (x-3)^2 - 4$$\n\n故 $(x-3)^2 = 4$，得 $x-3 = \\pm 2$。\n\n因此 $x = 5$ 或 $x = 1$。","solutionImages":[],"altSolution":"","commonMistakes":"","textbookRef":"","recognizedPrompt":"","solutionVerified":true,"unclearCount":0},{"id":"sample-quad-p2","label":"練習","prompt":"解方程 $x^2 + 4x - 12 = 0$。","promptImages":[],"solution":"$$x^2 + 4x - 12 = (x+2)^2 - 4 - 12 = (x+2)^2 - 16$$\n\n故 $(x+2)^2 = 16$，$x+2 = \\pm 4$。\n\n因此 $x = 2$ 或 $x = -6$。","solutionImages":[],"altSolution":"","commonMistakes":"","textbookRef":"","recognizedPrompt":"","solutionVerified":true,"unclearCount":0}],"published":true,"createdAt":"2026-09-01T13:42:12.526Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-01T13:42:12.526Z","solutionsRelease":"visible","solutionsReleaseAt":null,"kind":"classwork","dueAt":null}}
